@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registro (HU-01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diego Pérez",
  "email": "diego@example.com",
  "password": "Secreta#2026"
}

### Login (HU-02) — guarda el token para las siguientes peticiones
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear post (HU-03)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mi primer post",
  "content": "Hola desde la API."
}

### Listar con paginación (HU-04)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar por usuario (HU-05)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?userId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mis posts (HU-06)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ordenar por fecha de creación ascendente (HU-07)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?sort=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar post propio (HU-08)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Título actualizado"
}

### Eliminar post propio (HU-08)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
